# Normalize text files to LF in the repository and in every checkout, whatever
# the local core.autocrlf (the site is built and served on Linux).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch line endings, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
